{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31096","headline":"塞上蒙汝州任中丞寄书 · 薛能","name":"塞上蒙汝州任中丞寄书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三省推贤两掖才，关东深许稍迟回。\n舟浮汝水通淮去，雨出嵩峰到郡来。\n投札转京忧不远，枉缄经虏喜初开。\n西楼一望知无极，更与何人把酒桮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}